    "content": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 1
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Two-input AND gate \u2014 the precursor gate"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "blockquote",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Directive \u2014 Clear the 20-fold criterion at two inputs, which the charter makes a precondition for attempting three."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Architecture"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Repression-based AND: "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-17d5acad",
              "label": "R0010 (pLac)",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-17d5acad",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/R0010_AB",
              "contentHash": null,
              "objectUuid": null
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-84f9f52b",
              "label": "R0040 (pTet)",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-84f9f52b",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/R0040_AB",
              "contentHash": null,
              "objectUuid": null
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " each drive a repressor, and the output unit is derepressed only when both inputs are present."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Regulators "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-ff80508d",
              "label": "C0012m (LacI)",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-ff80508d",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/C0012m_CD",
              "contentHash": null,
              "objectUuid": null
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-a8dc997d",
              "label": "C0040 (TetR)",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-a8dc997d",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/C0040_CD",
              "contentHash": null,
              "objectUuid": null
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "; output "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-694681f1",
              "label": "E1010m (mRFP)",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-694681f1",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/E1010m_CD",
              "contentHash": null,
              "objectUuid": null
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " through "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-7981ffa1",
              "label": "B0034m",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-7981ffa1",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/B0034m_BC",
              "contentHash": null,
              "objectUuid": null
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", terminated by "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-5427ea3f",
              "label": "B0015",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-5427ea3f",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/B0015_DE",
              "contentHash": null,
              "objectUuid": null
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", assembled into "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-825ea421",
              "label": "DVK_EF",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-825ea421",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/DVK_EF",
              "contentHash": null,
              "objectUuid": null
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Why repression rather than a split activator"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A split activator gives a sharper transfer function but needs two well-matched expression levels. Entry 03 showed the promoter ladder here is compressed, so matching is unreliable. Repression trades steepness for robustness, which the charter values more."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Result"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "34-fold ON/OFF at mid-exponential. Criterion cleared. The OFF state sits 8 percent above the floor, consistent with the compounded read-through measured in entry 06 \u2014 a prediction that held."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Gate to the next stage"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Charter precondition satisfied. Entry 12 attempts three inputs; entry 10 first measures what this gate already costs the host."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
